    "body": "## Scope: Chat 03B2 (PRIVATE ALPHA PROTOTYPE, NOT DEPLOYED)\n\n**Stacked Draft PR** based on `social-combat-chat03b1-d1-cas-20261017` ([PR #440](https://github.com/samuray-games/AsyncScene/pull/440)). Contains only 03B2-owned files relative to parent. No changes to telemetry, active browser runtime, Stage7.15, NPC, economy, voting, or production secrets.\n\n- `gameplay-server/src/worker.js` runs the **merged pure Chat 03A lifecycle+resolver** server-side. Trusted `Date.now()`, generated battle IDs, no client actorId/role or state accepted for commands, strict participant public views only.\n- Admin-only bootstrap (separate `ADMIN_CONTROL_TOKEN`, NOT telemetry owner token) mints two random 256-bit **battle-scoped bearer capabilities**; only SHA-256 token digests stored in separate `0002_battle_capabilities.sql` table. Admin distributes capabilities privately. This is a private-alpha capability-auth design, **NOT permanent user account identity**.\n- Genesis snapshot + `battle.created` + both capability records use D1 transactional `batch()` from parent PR #440.\n- Participant `GET /v1/battles/:id` (reconnect on another device), `POST /v1/battles/:id/commit`; server authenticates capability and derives actorId, regenerates expectedVersion on CAS retries, provides idempotent command receipts and rejects changed same-command payloads.\n- Trusted automatic `reveal` after both commits and scheduled retry/timeout handling; **no finalize/recognition/voting bypass**, pending Chat05 gate. Never expose internal snapshot or opponent selection before reveal.\n- Dedicated `wrangler.api-local-test.jsonc` is local-only; tests exercise isolated workerd/D1 with synthetic admin secret. No remote Worker or real player data.\n\n## Gates / limitations\n\n- First prove exact-head CI tests and independent review. This PR is **Draft / NOT READY / NOT MERGEABLE** until parent #440 is reviewed and integrated.\n- Privacy/retention/backup schedule, actual identity provider, abuse controls/rate limiting, CORS allowlist and production admin bootstrap/distribution procedure **not approved**. No Cloudflare-hosted Worker deployment, no Safari acceptance.\n- Capability tokens are transferable bearer secrets; clients cannot be distinguished as permanent verified human accounts. No user account signup, token rotation/revocation, auditing or public PvP security claim.\n- Mafia/V12 excluded; no recognizedOutcome/finalization without Chat05.\n\n[Authority issue #439](https://github.com/samuray-games/AsyncScene/issues/439).",
